  "description": "The ground floor will retain the existing pharmacy at the front. A central passage divides the internal layout, with two consultation rooms on the left and a long dispensary on the right, accessible from the passage. The passage continues to a kitchen, an adjacent office, and a common toilet. A hallway next to the office leads to a large storage area, also accessible from the dispensary. At the rear of the storage area is a physiotherapy consultation room with separate rear access.\n\nThe first floor will be converted into a self-contained residential unit, accessed via a new external staircase at the rear. It includes an open-plan living room with kitchen, a hallway leading to three well-sized, naturally lit bedrooms, and a common bathroom. The existing roof will remain unchanged.",
